---
import Layout from '../components/layout/Layout.astro';

const title = "Privacy Policy | Love4Prompts";
const description = "Privacy Policy for Love4Prompts. Learn how we handle your email subscriptions, analytics data, and prompt data.";
---

<Layout title={title} description={description}>
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 py-16 text-white relative z-10">
    <div class="mb-12">
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-light tracking-tight mb-2 text-white">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="text-white/40 text-sm font-mono">Last updated: June 2026</p>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-10">
      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white/90">1. What We Collect</h2>
        <p class="text-[var(--color-text-secondary)] leading-relaxed text-sm">
          We collect minimal information to provide and improve our service. This includes:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 text-[var(--color-text-secondary)] leading-relaxed text-sm space-y-2">
          <li><strong>Email address:</strong> Only if you explicitly subscribe to our newsletter. This is securely stored using <a href="https://supabase.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-[var(--color-primary)] hover:underline">Supabase</a>, a secure cloud database service.</li>
          <li><strong>Usage data:</strong> Collected via Microsoft Clarity. This records heatmaps, session clicks, and general interaction patterns in an anonymized form to help us optimize the toolkit.</li>
          <li><strong>Prompts:</strong> The text you input is processed in real-time by Groq AI to generate optimized prompt suggestions. We do not store or retain your prompt text on our servers.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white/90">2. How We Use It</h2>
        <p class="text-[var(--color-text-secondary)] leading-relaxed text-sm">
          We use the information we collect for the following purposes:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 text-[var(--color-text-secondary)] leading-relaxed text-sm space-y-2">
          <li>To send weekly prompt ideas, templates, and updates directly to your inbox (only if subscribed). You can opt-out at any time.</li>
          <li>To analyze general usage patterns and fix bugs.</li>
          <li><strong>We never sell, rent, or share your personal data with third-party advertisers or brokers.</strong></li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white/90">3. Third Party Services</h2>
        <p class="text-[var(--color-text-secondary)] leading-relaxed text-sm">
          We integrate with the following trusted third-party platforms to run the service:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 text-[var(--color-text-secondary)] leading-relaxed text-sm space-y-2">
          <li><strong>Database:</strong> Supabase (<a href="https://supabase.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-[var(--color-primary)] hover:underline">supabase.com/privacy</a>)</li>
          <li><strong>Analytics:</strong> Microsoft Clarity (<a href="https://microsoft.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-[var(--color-primary)] hover:underline">microsoft.com/privacy</a>)</li>
          <li><strong>AI Inference:</strong> Groq (<a href="https://groq.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-[var(--color-primary)] hover:underline">groq.com/privacy</a>)</li>
          <li><strong>Hosting:</strong> Vercel (<a href="https://vercel.com/legal/privacy-policy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-[var(--color-primary)] hover:underline">vercel.com/legal/privacy-policy</a>)</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white/90">4. Cookies</h2>
        <p class="text-[var(--color-text-secondary)] leading-relaxed text-sm">
          We use standard storage technologies to keep your session state lightweight:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 text-[var(--color-text-secondary)] leading-relaxed text-sm space-y-2">
          <li><strong>localStorage:</strong> We use local storage (not cookies) to remember your model choices and recent prompt history locally on your device.</li>
          <li><strong>Microsoft Clarity:</strong> Clarity uses cookies to identify unique user sessions and compile behavior analytics.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white/90">5. Your Rights</h2>
        <p class="text-[var(--color-text-secondary)] leading-relaxed text-sm">
          You have complete control over your data:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 text-[var(--color-text-secondary)] leading-relaxed text-sm space-y-2">
          <li>To request immediate deletion of your email from our database, contact us at <a href="mailto:nishchaydev@outlook.com" class="text-[var(--color-primary)] hover:underline">nishchaydev@outlook.com</a>.</li>
          <li>To delete your cached prompt history and preferences, simply clear your browser's site data or local storage.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white/90">6. Contact</h2>
        <p class="text-[var(--color-text-secondary)] leading-relaxed text-sm">
          If you have any questions about this privacy policy, email us at <a href="mailto:nishchaydev@outlook.com" class="text-[var(--color-primary)] hover:underline">nishchaydev@outlook.com</a>.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
